---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>THE HALL OF FAME</h1>
			<p>
				This league has gone on long enough where there have been both highlights and lowlights.
				From draft picks to trades, these are the selections that truly left a legacy for the league. 
			</p>
            <h2>Greatest League Moment: The Six Team Megatrade</h2>
            <p>
                The standout moment in league history, the massive six-team blockbuster. Originally constructed
                as a way for Matt to try and get Ausar Thompson from Anthony, more and more teams got added until
                every team got pulled in. The trade ended up as follows:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li> Matt: </li>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Receives: Zach Edey, Ausar Thompson, Isaiah Jackson, Jalen Hood-Schifino</li>
                        <li>Gives up: Moses Moody, Dalton Knecht, Ron Holland, Taylor Hendricks, 2024 Winter R2 Swap with Mitchell</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li> Anthony: </li>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Receives: Sam's 2025 Summer R2, Dlaton Knecht, Ron Holland, Taylor Hendricks, Anthony Black</li>
                        <li>Gives up: Ausar Thompson</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li> Michael: </li>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Receives: Jeremy Sochan, Yves Missi, Precious Achiuwa</li>
                        <li>Gives up: Kyle Filipowski, Bilal Coulibaly, Jaden McDaniels, Baylor Scheierman</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li> Mitchell: </li>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Receives: Moses Moody, Jaden McDaniels, Bilal Coulibaly, 2024 Winter R2 Swap with Matt, AJ Griffin</li>
                        <li>Gives up: Precious Achiuwa, Anthony Black, Yves Missi, Jalen Hood-Schifino, Josh Primo, Zach Edey, Isaiah Jackson</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li> Sam: </li>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Receives: Kyle Filipowski, Baylor Scheierman</li>
                        <li>Gives up: 2025 Summer R2</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li> Mr. L: </li>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Receives: Josh Primo</li>
                        <li>Gives up: AJ Griffin</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
            </ul>
        <h2>Greatest Draft Steals:</h2>
        <p>
            There are some all time draft steals that have happened in this league. Here are some of the highlights:
        </p>
        <h4> Anthony selects Victor Wembanyama R1P6 of the Summer 2021 Draft </h4>
        <p>
            You're not going to find any other round one draft picks here. But Anthony got the 
            best fantasy player in the NBA after every other owner passed on him. He was first
            and he was right. Picks like this are what makes Anthony competitive despite the misplays.
        </p>
        <h4> Michael selects Herb Jones R2P? of the Winter 2021 Draft </h4>
        <p>
            The first great active player picked in the expansion draft. Herb Jones is a standout, putting up
            great stock numbers with good shooting. Expansion seconds almost never turn out, but this
            was one of the times it did.
        </p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
